# Daily jobs of the "backup" service (system_design.md §5, "Scheduled Jobs"), run by supercronic.
# Times are UTC (the container's time zone). Fields: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command.

# Database dump -> gzip -> age encryption -> private R2 backup bucket, as backups/YYYY-MM-DD.sql.gz.age.
0 2 * * * python manage.py backup_database

# Remove expired rows from the JWT outstanding/blacklist tables.
30 2 * * * python manage.py flushexpiredtokens

# Deactivate the cafes whose paid time is over (UC-ADMIN-012). 21:10 UTC is 00:10 in Damascus (UTC+3 all
# year), ten minutes after the last paid day ended there.
10 21 * * * python manage.py expire_subscriptions
